ot/pull/101520.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101520.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Added comment clarifying macro nomenclature in servers/server_wrap_mt_common.h\r\n\r\n> Macros for wrapping multithreaded server calls.\r\n> - FUNC{n} is a straightforward call w/no return type that takes n arguments (implicitly C given that n is 0).\r\n> - FUNC{n}R is a call to a method with a return type.\r\n> - FUNC{n}S is a call to a method that requires synchronization with the main thread.\r\n> - FUNC{n}C is const, indicating that the method does not mutate internal server state.\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101520/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101520/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}